{"unit_id":"tag:08PK:statement","translation":"假设与记号如情形 <REF_0001> 中所述。对于阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf）<MATH_0001>，位于 <MATH_0002> 上，层（sheaf）<MATH_0003> 是与预层（presheaf）\n<MATH_0004>\n相联系的层（sheaf）。记号与限制（restriction）映射（maps）见证明。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"下惊叹的系数"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"纤维同调层化后的比较"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"局部范畴上的同调"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"预层的结构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"限制箭头"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08PK:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001>。范畴（category）<MATH_0002> 是由对（pairs）<MATH_0003> 组成的范畴（category），其中 <MATH_0004> 是 <MATH_0005> 的态射（morphism），且 <MATH_0006>，即 <MATH_0007> 是纤维（fibre）范畴（category）<MATH_0008> 的态射（morphism）。态射（Morphisms）<MATH_0009> 由态射（morphisms）<MATH_0010> 给出，属于纤维（fibre）范畴（category）<MATH_0011>，使得 <MATH_0012>。预层（presheaf）<MATH_0013> 将 <MATH_0014> 送到 <MATH_0015>。将在下面构造限制（restriction）映射（mappings）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n选取分解（factorization）\n<MATH_0016>，\n属于 <MATH_0017>，如《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0001> 中所述。则 <MATH_0018>，对导出函子（derived functors）也类似。另一方面，函子（functor）<MATH_0019> 正合（exact），见《位点上的模（Modules on Sites）》引理 <REF_0002>。所以得到 <MATH_0020>，其中 <MATH_0021>。注意，<MATH_0022>，其中 <MATH_0023> 是拓扑斯的态射（morphism of topoi），与 <MATH_0024> 相联系，见《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0003>。函子（functor）<MATH_0025> 将 <MATH_0026> 变为 <MATH_0027> 上的纤维范畴（fibred category），因此引理 <REF_0004> 适用于 <MATH_0028> 的计算。结果得出，因为 <MATH_0029> 的构造，位于《范畴（Categories）》引理 <REF_0005> 的证明中，表明纤维（fibre）范畴（category）<MATH_0030> 等于 <MATH_0031>。此外，<MATH_0032> 由上述规则给出（因为 <MATH_0033> 连续（continuous）且余连续（cocontinuous），由《叠（Stacks）》引理 <REF_0006>，所以可应用《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0007>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"pairs","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"mappings","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"derived functors","target_term":"导出函子"},{"source_ter