{"unit_id":"tag:09D0:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001> 为单纯（simplicial）环（ring）。回忆，可将 <MATH_0002> 视为 <MATH_0003> 上的层（sheaf）（赋予混沌（chaotic）拓扑（topology）），见《单纯（Simplicial）》第 <REF_0001> 节。于是单纯（simplicial）模（module）<MATH_0004>，定义在 <MATH_0005> 上，就是 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）的层（sheaf），位于 <MATH_0007> 上。换言之，对每个 <MATH_0008>，有 <MATH_0009>-模（module）<MATH_0010>，对每个映射（map）<MATH_0011>，有对应的映射（map）\n<MATH_0012>，\n它是 <MATH_0013>-线性（linear）的，使得这些映射（maps）以通常方式复合。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0014> 为位点（site）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>单纯环层（simplicial sheaf of rings）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0015>，位于 <MATH_0016> 上，是 <MATH_0017> 上环层（sheaves of rings）的范畴（category）中的单纯对象（simplicial object）。此时，对应 <MATH_0018> 是单纯（simplicial）环（rings）的层（sheaf），而事实上这两个概念等价（equivalent）。对于单纯（simplicial）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaves）、单纯（simplicial）层（sheaves），取值于 Lie 代数（algebras），等等，也有类似讨论。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n然而，如上面的单纯（simplicial）环（rings）情形，还有另一种理解单纯（simplicial）层（sheaves）的方式。具体而言，考虑投影（projection）\n<MATH_0019>。\n这定义一个纤维范畴（fibred category），其中强笛卡尔（strongly cartesian）态射（morphisms）恰好是形如 <MATH_0020> 的态射（morphisms）。赋予范畴（category）<MATH_0021> 从 <MATH_0022> 继承的拓扑（topology）（见《叠（Stacks）》第 <REF_0002> 节）。<MATH_0023> 中覆盖（coverings）的简单描述（《叠（Stacks）》引理 <REF_0003>）立即蕴含：<MATH_0024> 上的单纯环层（simplicial sheaf of rings）等同于 <MATH_0025> 上的环层（sheaf of rings）。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n类比单纯（simplicial）环（ring）上的单纯（simplicial）模（modules）情形，如下定义单纯（simplicial）环层（sheaves of rings）上的单纯（simplicial）模（modules）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Lie"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"linear","target_term":"线性"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"simplicial sheaf of rings","target_term":"单纯环层"},{"source_term":"sheaves of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"simplicial object","target_term":"单纯对象"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaves","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"projection","target_term":"投影"},{"source_term":"fibred category","target_term":"纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"strongly cartesian","target_term":"强笛卡尔"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"simplicial sheaf of rings","target_term":"单纯环层"},{"source_term":"sheaf of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"sheaves of rings","target_term":"环层"},{"source_term":"simplicial","target_term":"单纯"},{"source_term":"module